Mid-Values Series
Mid-value or Mid-point is the middle value of a class-interval.
When such mid-values are given, it is called mid-value series.
Steps to convert Mid-value Series to Continuous Series
Step 1: First of all, calculate the difference
between the two mid-values.
Step 2: Then, half of the difference is
subtracted and added to each mid-value
to find the lower and upper limits
respectively of the class-intervals.
